##### ShellWave  
*solo* 

A 15 L micro-bubble column recirculates pristine water for mussels and clams. A UV-C/ozone loop sterilises continuously, and auto-chill drops temperature pre-harvest.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Edible molluscs – all 10 Balcony species  

